		"request": "Two Produce v11 frames to the same empty partition. Both batches carry producerId 90000 and producerEpoch 0 in the v2 batch header (the int64 and int16 that follow maxTimestamp, with baseSequence as the int32 after them). The first, correlation id 362, has baseSequence 0 and two records; the second, correlation id 363, has baseSequence 7 and one record.",
