		"response": "Frame 362 answers error_code 0 (NONE) with base_offset 0 — sequences 0 and 1 are now stored for that producer. Frame 363 answers error_code 45 (OUT_OF_ORDER_SEQUENCE_NUMBER), because the next batch had to start at sequence 2, and nothing is appended: the high watermark stays 2.",
